  m_text: "CREDITS\n\nEmmy Stevens - Bringer of Plague\r\nCreative Director, Graphical
    Artist\r\n\r\nMJ Antenor - Dread\u2019s Heartbeat\r\nProject Manager, UI Artist\r\n\r\nAlex
    Basi - The One Who Shakes Earth\u2019s Harmony\r\nCoder, Composer\r\n\r\nNoah
    Grassle - Weapon\u2019s Smith\r\nCoder\r\n\r\nVixen Beals - Burrower of the Deep\r\nLevel
    Designer, Coder\r\n\r\nJaden Painter - Harbinger of Life and Hardship\r\nCoder,
    Level Designer\r\n\r\nNick Granada - Bard of Harmony and Cacophony\r\nSound Designer,
    Music Maker, Coder\r\n\r\nReed Parkhill - Plead of the Afflicted\r\nSFX Artist,
    Level Designer\r\n\r\nOrion Allman - Carver of the Caverns\r\nLevel Designer,
    Trailer Editor\r\n\r\nNoah Green - Professional Tunneler\r\nLevel Designer\r\n\r\nMolly
    O\u2019Kane - Architect for the Molded\r\nEnvironmental Pixel Artist\r\n\r\nGavin
    Dudenhoeffer - Savior of Item Aesthetics\r\nItem Artist\r\n\r\nIsaac Jones -
    Head Stone Smith\r\nEnvironmental Pixel Artist, Animator\r\n\r\nMichael Capriel
    - High Craftsman of Flesh\r\nCharacter Pixel Artist, Animator\r\n\r\nFatema Salem
    - Shrew Keeper\r\nPixel Animator\r\n\r\nZ.D.Prince - Feudal Lord\r\nNarrative
    Work and Level Design\r\n\r\nKirbizoid - Voice of the Damned\r\nVoice Actor"
